flowchart TD
  A[Patient signs in] --> B[Create appointment: CONFIRMED]
  B --> C[Check in with Idempotency-Key]
  C --> D{Within half-open arrival window?}
  D -- No --> E[409; no mutation]
  D -- Yes --> F[Atomic transaction: CHECKED_IN + one WAITING ticket + replay response]
  F --> G[Receptionist views queue]
  G --> H[Call ticket with If-Match version]
  H --> I{Version current?}
  I -- No --> J[412; refresh queue]
  I -- Yes --> K[Ticket becomes CALLED]
